window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Fastball Fever</i></b><b> is the first book in the All-American Men series of sports romance, told exclusively from the male perspective.</b><br> <br> Injured baseball player Charlie Braddock fears he's lost his game. But the arrival of his new coach shakes things up in ways he could never have anticipated. His coach is a woman. A sexy one. But Amy Keller is all business and determined to whip him into shape.<br> <br> Perfect. That's what every guy needs when he's on the verge of being traded or sent back to the minors. But just when he sees a ray of light…<br> <br> His ex-wife shows up.</p>"; 
